Motor Insurance Claim Checklist

Before submitting a claim, have:

Required Documents
- Copy of insurance policy
- Driver’s license
- Vehicle logbook copy
- Police abstract (if applicable)
- Accident photos
- Repair estimates
- Claim form

Immediate Steps After Accident
- [ ] Ensure safety
- [ ] Record incident details
- [ ] Take photographs
- [ ] Inform insurer
- [ ] File claim

Notes
Keep copies of every document submitted.
Follow up regularly until claim settlement.

